# Butler Routes - The Barrens rares and treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 32 rank-flagged rares of The Barrens
# (zone key 1413), verified against the local Forever game data
# (questie-forever npc/object/item dumps). Every goal is optional - a
# missing spawn never wedges the guide. Hagg Taurenbane holds three
# points and loops them; every other rare holds a single point and gets
# a plain single-goto step. Three rares drop signature leather patterns
# that ride as optional collects with notes (world-drop tables
# elsewhere - the recipes companion does not list them as zone
# content); all other loot is ordinary greens, noted not goaled.
# Humar the Pridelord carries the guide's one tame line (drop evidence
# plus the core guide's Savannah-lion kills as corroboration); no other
# beast's family is confirmable from the data (see
# docs/companion-unverified.md). Takk the Leaper stays out - the core
# guide already routes its kill for Raptor Horns (865). The three rares
# above the core band (Brontus, Gerogg, Aean, Hagg) ship with honest
# come-back-later notes; Darkmist Widow, Ambassador Bloodrage and
# Burgle Eye (levels 36-40) are out of scope. Treasures ride one loop
# over the fixed generic-chest points plus their own steps for the
# unique objects. No accept/turnin lines anywhere - the core guide owns
# every quest.
guide butler-routes-completionist/barrens-rares
title The Barrens - Rares & Treasures
levels 10-25
zone The Barrens
faction Horde
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords barrens, rares, treasures, collectibles, companions
coords live
version 1

step Crossroads south - Trigore the Lasher

  zone map 1413

  goto 48.29,33.07
  kill 3652 optional
  collect 2407 "Pattern: White Leather Jerkin" optional
  note Trigore the Lasher (level 19 rare) holds a single point south of the Crossroads. The White Leather Jerkin pattern is its signature loot in the data (a world-drop table elsewhere - the recipes companion does not list it as zone content).
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

